The last year, it's completely different from what I was doing before in a good way,

34
00:03:35,760 --> 00:03:36,760
I think.

35
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:43,520
To answer your question more shortly, I always knew I wanted to fly.

36
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:45,600
That's always been a goal.

37
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:51,160
The hospital you're working at, you were in an ICU and as a trauma surgical ICU, right

