00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:05,200
Morgan and I worked together in the ICU and now we work at the same base for CareFlight

44
00:04:05,200 --> 00:04:06,200
here in Santa Fe.

45
00:04:06,200 --> 00:04:07,200
Yeah.

46
00:04:07,200 --> 00:04:08,200
Up there in Santa Fe.

