78
00:06:20,320 --> 00:06:25,560
It's only been a little over a year for me in that arena.

79
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:29,480
So it still feels pretty.

80
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:31,080
It can feel overwhelming sometimes.

81
00:06:31,080 --> 00:06:36,400
Currently, I just got through a bunch of quarterly innovations and quarterly stuff

82
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:37,400
