83
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:45,520
It's like stressing to get that done before the 20th while studying for my CFRN.

84
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:47,480
So when you test.

85
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:48,480
Next month.

86
00:06:48,480 --> 00:06:49,480
Nice.

87
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:50,480
Yeah.

88
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:51,480
Yeah.

89
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:55,240
So I'm not looking forward to it.

90
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:58,800
But it's a necessary evil in the process.

91
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:06,360
It's weird to do like a certification that your job requires you to have.

92
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:11,960
So there's this like added pressure of like, yeah, if I fail again, then I lose my job.

93
00:07:11,960 --> 00:07:12,960
Like, that sucks.

94
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:13,960
Yeah.

95
00:07:13,960 --> 00:07:16,120
Because I guess normally you would like get the certification first.

96
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:19,520
So it's behind you before you transition into the job.

97
00:07:19,520 --> 00:07:20,520
Yeah.

98
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:21,520
Huh.

99
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:22,520
Interesting.

100
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:23,520
Yeah.

