00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:54,480
So kind of in protest.

110
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:57,840
I just took all my Vans certs and was like, you guys should pay me more.

111
00:07:57,840 --> 00:07:58,840
Yeah.

112
00:07:58,840 --> 00:07:59,840
And they were like, no.

113
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:00,840
And I was like, cool.

114
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:01,840
I'm going to leave.

115
00:08:01,840 --> 00:08:03,760
And then let me come back eventually.

116
00:08:03,760 --> 00:08:06,120
But yeah, that's why I did it that way.

117
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:13,040
I thought maybe I could, you know, shift the seas of which I come through if I like, yeah,

118
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:18,240
stronger of them and with all my pieces of paper, but they're very sad in their ways.

119
00:08:18,240 --> 00:08:19,240
Yeah.

120
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:20,240
But yeah, that's okay.

121
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:21,480
They let me come back eventually.

122
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:22,480
So it's fine.

123
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:30,040
Well, you know, and I think in that just hearing your story about it, it seems compared to

124
00:08:30,040 --> 00:08:36,240
where I'm at right now, like mentally, I'm like freaking out about this, you know, this

125
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:37,240
certification.

126
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:39,360
Like I failed once already.

127
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:42,400
I'm re-studying, you know, doing it again.

128
00:08:42,400 --> 00:08:44,480
And I'm going to retest.

129
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:48,120
Where you were like, you had your FPC, like you just went to nurses.

130
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:50,720
People were like, well, I'm just going to take this test now.

131
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:52,280
Yeah, it's safe stuff.

132
00:08:52,280 --> 00:08:53,280
Yeah.

133
00:08:53,280 --> 00:08:54,280
Yeah.

134
00:08:54,280 --> 00:08:56,720
And I think I'm also pretty lucky in that, that I've always done pretty well at taking

