00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:10,880
You know, that I think would be beneficial.

177
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:11,880
Yeah.

178
00:11:11,880 --> 00:11:17,760
I think a hospital like UNM where they have a dedicated PDR is an available option.

179
00:11:17,760 --> 00:11:18,760
Right.

180
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:19,760
Right.

181
00:11:19,760 --> 00:11:23,000
Now the flip side of that though, I think is, does it really matter?

